# Response headers for the static app on Cloudflare (Workers static assets).
# - Referrer-Policy same-origin: links and images to other sites (VietQR, the
#   bank-app page, Google sign-in) never learn this app's address, which is the
#   only thing keeping its public data out of view. Requests within the app
#   keep theirs.
# - X-Frame-Options DENY: no other site can show the app in a frame.
# - X-Content-Type-Options nosniff: files are only ever read as their stated type.
/*
  Referrer-Policy: same-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
